@startuml
title S8  Authorize each personal request  US-15
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontColor #172A3A
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam ArrowColor #345A72
skinparam Shadowing false
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam TitleFontColor #123A52
skinparam TitleFontSize 19
skinparam ClassBackgroundColor #EDF5FA
skinparam ClassBorderColor #456F89
skinparam ComponentBackgroundColor #EDF5FA
skinparam ComponentBorderColor #456F89
skinparam PackageBorderColor #456F89
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #E6F4F0
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #417364
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor #EDF5FA
skinparam SequenceGroupBorderColor #617C8D
hide footbox
autonumber
actor User
participant "Web UI" as UI
participant "Protected routes" as API
participant JwtGuard as Guard
participant TokenService as Token
participant "Feature service" as Feature
database "Owner-qualified repository" as Store
User -> UI : request a personal action
UI -> API : personal request with bearer JWT
API -> Guard : requireOwner(token)
Guard -> Token : verify(token)
alt missing, invalid or expired
  Token --> Guard : authentication error
  Guard --> API : denied
  API --> UI : 401; feature not invoked
else valid signature and claims
  Token --> Guard : verified subject
  Guard --> API : owner from subject
  API -> Feature : action(owner, validated input)
  note right of API : Ignore client-supplied owner fields.
  Feature -> Store : read or mutate scoped by owner
  alt referenced object has no owned match
    Store --> Feature : absent; no mutation
    Feature --> API : unavailable
    API --> UI : 404
  else authorized collection or object
    Store --> Feature : owned result
    Feature --> API : feature response
    API --> UI : route-specific status and body
  end
end
@enduml
